# Forgejo CODEOWNERS
# Syntax: <path-glob>  <owner-or-team> [<owner-or-team> ...]
# Enforced by the branch protection rule "Require approval from code owners".

# Anything that can run in CI or hold secrets must be reviewed by the owner,
# even if the author has collaborator rights. This closes the supply-chain
# attack where a PR modifies its own workflow to exfiltrate AI_REVIEW_TOKEN.
/.forgejo/          @jan
/.github/           @jan
/CODEOWNERS         @jan
/.forgejo/CODEOWNERS @jan
